  "title": "Does Uninsured Motorist Cover Hit and Run?",
  "excerpt": "Motorcycle accidents can be devastating, and when the at-fault driver flees the scene, the situation becomes even more stressful. Many riders wonder, Does uninsured motorists cover hit-and-run accidents? In many cases, uninsured motorist (UM) coverage may protect you if a negligent driver leaves the scene without taking responsibility. Understanding how this coverage works is essential […]",
  "publishedAt": "2025-04-21T09:00:05",
  "modifiedAt": "2026-02-26T16:48:20",
  "categories": [
    "motorcycle-accidents"
  ],
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9fu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l9fp",
