          "href": "/motorcycle-accident-lawyer-denver/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9fo",
          "text": "Motorcycle accidents can be devastating, and when the at-fault driver flees the scene, the situation becomes even more stressful. Many riders wonder, ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9fq",
          "text": "Does uninsured motorists cover hit-and-run",
          "marks": [
            "l9fp",
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9fr",
          "text": " accidents? ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9fs",
          "text": "In many cases, uninsured motorist (UM) coverage may protect you if a negligent driver leaves the scene without taking responsibility.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9g3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l9g0",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/motorcycle-accident-lawyer-denver/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9fv",
          "text": "Understanding how this coverage works is essential for protecting yourself on the road. Additionally, many riders are unaware that ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9fw",
          "text": "some policies may impose restrictions on hit-and-run claims, such as requiring physical contact with another vehicle.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9fx",
          "text": " At ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9fy",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9fz",
          "text": ", we help ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9g1",
          "text": "motorcycle accident victims in Colorado",
          "marks": [
            "l9g0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9g2",
          "text": " secure the compensation they deserve.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9g5",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9g4",
          "text": "What is Uninsured Motorist Coverage?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9gc",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l9g6",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://leg.colorado.gov/content/optional-automobile-insurance-coverage"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9g7",
          "text": "Uninsured motorist (UM) coverage",
          "marks": [
            "l9g6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9g8",
          "text": " is an auto insurance policy that ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9g9",
          "text": "may compensate you if an at-fault driver does not have insurance or if you are involved in a hit-and-run accident.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ga",
          "text": " Since some motorists fail to carry the required liability insurance, this coverage provides financial protection when another party cannot pay for damages. In many cases, ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gb",
          "text": "motorcycle riders are at greater risk because they are more vulnerable in accidents involving uninsured or hit-and-run drivers.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ge",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gd",
          "text": "UM coverage typically includes:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9gh",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gf",
          "text": "Uninsured Motorist Bodily Injury (UMBI):",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gg",
          "text": " Covers medical expenses, lost wages, and pain and suffering.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9gk",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gi",
          "text": "Uninsured Motorist Property Damage (UMPD):",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gj",
          "text": " Pays for damage to your motorcycle if the at-fault driver is uninsured or unidentified.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9gn",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gl",
          "text": "Additional expenses:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gm",
          "text": " Some policies may also cover rehabilitation costs and long-term disability care.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9gp",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9go",
          "text": "Should You Consider Uninsured Motorist Coverage?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9gu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gq",
          "text": "Many motorcyclists believe they are fully covered by standard insurance. Still, ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gr",
          "text": "without UM protection, you may be left paying for medical bills and repairs out of pocket if an uninsured driver causes an accident.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gs",
          "text": " Considering the high cost of motorcycle injuries, UM insurance could be a crucial safeguard. ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gt",
          "text": "Motorcycle riders face a disproportionate risk of severe injuries, making UM coverage even more critical for those who ride frequently.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9gw",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gv",
          "text": "In which states is uninsured/underinsured motorist coverage required?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9h0",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gx",
          "text": "Some states mandate UM/UIM insurance, while others leave it optional.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gy",
          "text": " In Colorado, insurers must offer uninsured motorist coverage, but policyholders may reject it in writing. However, considering the number of uninsured drivers on the road, it is advisable to carry this coverage. ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9gz",
          "text": "In states requiring UM coverage, the policy limits vary, and riders should verify their minimum coverage levels.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9h2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9h1",
          "text": "States that require UM/UIM coverage include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9h4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9h3",
          "text": "Connecticut",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9h6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9h5",
          "text": "New York",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9h8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9h7",
          "text": "Illinois",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ha",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9h9",
          "text": "Missouri",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hc",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hb",
          "text": "West Virginia",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9he",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hd",
          "text": "More states may require this coverage due to increasing uninsured motorist rates.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hg",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hf",
          "text": "Uninsured Motorist Insurance Coverage Explained",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hm",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l9hk",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://colorado.public.law/statutes/crs_10-4-609"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hh",
          "text": "UM insurance ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hi",
          "text": "may cover financial losses",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hj",
          "text": " resulting from accidents with uninsured or underinsured drivers and hit-and-run incidents. ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hl",
          "text": "Coverage can include:",
          "marks": [
            "l9hk"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hn",
          "text": "Medical bills:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ho",
          "text": " Hospitalization, rehabilitation, and ongoing care expenses.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hs",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hq",
          "text": "Lost wages:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hr",
          "text": " Compensation for time missed at work due to injuries.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hv",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ht",
          "text": "Property damage:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hu",
          "text": " If your policy includes UMPD, your motorcycle repair or replacement costs may be covered.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9hy",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hw",
          "text": "Pain and suffering:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hx",
          "text": " Some policies compensate for non-economic damages.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9i1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9hz",
          "text": "Legal fees:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9i0",
          "text": " If you need to pursue a claim against an uninsured driver, some policies may help with legal costs.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9i3",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9i2",
          "text": "Does Uninsured Motorist Insurance Cover Hit-and-Run Accidents?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9in",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9i4",
          "text": "Depending on your policy,",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9i5",
          "text": " ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9i6",
          "text": "uninsured",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9i7",
          "text": " ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9i8",
          "text": "motorist",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9i9",
          "text": " ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ia",
          "text": "coverage",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ib",
          "text": " ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ic",
          "text": "may",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9id",
          "text": " ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ie",
          "text": "apply",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9if",
          "text": " ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ig",
          "text": "to",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ih",
          "text": " ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ii",
          "text": "hit-and-run",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ij",
          "text": " ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ik",
          "text": "accidents",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9il",
          "text": ". Since a hit-and-run driver is legally considered uninsured, UM insurance can cover medical costs and, if included, property damage. ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9im",
          "text": "However, some policies may require proof of impact, meaning minor hit-and-run accidents without physical contact may not be covered.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ir",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l9io",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://doi.colorado.gov/insurance-products/auto-insurance"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ip",
          "text": "Colorado law",
          "marks": [
            "l9io"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9iq",
          "text": " recognizes hit-and-run victims under UM coverage, but policy specifics vary. Riders should review their policies carefully to ensure adequate protection.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9it",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9is",
          "text": "Uninsured Motorist Property Damage vs. Collision Coverage",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9iz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9iu",
          "text": "Many policyholders confuse ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9iv",
          "text": "Uninsured Motorist Property Damage (UMPD)",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9iw",
          "text": " with ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ix",
          "text": "Collision Coverage.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9iy",
          "text": " While both help repair or replace your motorcycle, they serve different purposes:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9j1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9j0",
          "text": "UMPD may pay for damage caused by an uninsured or hit-and-run driver.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9j3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9j2",
          "text": "Collision coverage applies regardless of fault, covering damages after any accident.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9j5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9j4",
          "text": "Deductibles and coverage limits vary, so reviewing both options is essential.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9j8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9j6",
          "text": "Since Colorado does not require UMPD, many riders rely on collision coverage. However, ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9j7",
          "text": "including both in your policy may provide broader financial protection.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ja",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9j9",
          "text": "Do I need uninsured motorist bodily injury coverage if I have health insurance?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9jd",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9jb",
          "text": "Even with health insurance, UM bodily injury coverage may still be beneficial.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9jc",
